["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"296: Avoidance Feeds Anxiety: When to Make Teens Do Hard Things | Dr. Meredith Elkins exposure-based therapy accommodation SPACE program\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-asklisa-父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避-焦虑就越难治好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc857b2c3fda762e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>父母越是心疼著接送孩子逃避，焦慮就越難治好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迴避帶來的輕鬆會讓大腦記住「這件事我搞不定」,下次更想逃；真正管用的辦法是分級直面讓自己不舒服的事，這套框架對輕度緊張和臨床焦慮症同樣有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">焦慮障礙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"When Toddlers Resist Absolutely Everything the untethered twos\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-unruffled-两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题-而是情绪在自愈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">30:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>兩歲娃的瘋狂抵抗不是親子關係出問題，而是情緒在自愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩歲孩子對上車、洗澡、牽手過馬路樣樣說不，是因為經歷鉅變卻毫無掌控感，這時該做的不是給更多選擇，而是把邊界收得更早更緊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">兩歲兒童</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"“You’re Too Sensitive” Isn’t Helpful — Here’s What Is, with Dr. Sasha Hamdani RSD (Rejection Sensitive Dysphoria) amygdala prefrontal cortex DFK (deeply feeling kids) emotional vaccination\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-goodinside-怕被拒绝不是矫情-杏仁核过度警觉-前额叶跟不上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">49:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>怕被拒絕不是矯情：杏仁核過度警覺，前額葉跟不上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理醫生 Sasha Hamdani 說：被拒絕的恐懼不是性格問題，而是杏仁核過度警覺、前額葉反應不足導致的真實神經反應，道理勸不醒它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">拒絕敏感性煩躁症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Legal Agents When You Can&#x27;t See the Data - Jacob Lauritzen, CTO of Legora Tabular Review Forward Deployed Engineer Legal Engineer Pareto frontier DPA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-latentspace-法律ai最大的工程难题不是模型-是永远看不到真实数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/927785d01eabb481-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>法律AI最大的工程難題不是模型，是永遠看不到真實數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客戶數據大多連律所自己都無權查看，Legora的evals團隊只能靠分類和改寫後的合成數據，去猜測律師們真實在做什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Robots Already Working in American Factories | Tutor Intelligence teleoperator / tutor greenfield market HRI(Human-Robot Interaction) action diffusion transformer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-a16z-机器人创业公司不卖ai-只卖-时薪16美元-这句话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>機器人創業公司不賣AI,只賣「時薪16美元」這句話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tutor向從未買過機器人的工廠主推銷時，從不提模型和AI,只說一個數字——時薪16美元的機器人；這背後是美國一年僅部署3.8萬臺工業機器人、九成工廠空白的現實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Onion Futures Act corner long position short position open interest\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-stuffmissed-两个农民囤光洋葱操纵期货-让国会专门立法禁掉了洋葱期货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>兩個農民囤光洋蔥操縱期貨，讓國會專門立法禁掉了洋蔥期貨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩人聯手買下芝加哥幾乎全部洋蔥、逼經銷商籤秘密協議，又反手做空把價格砸到歷史最低，國會因此專門立法永久禁止洋蔥做期貨交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">期貨監管</span><span class=\"tag\">市場操縱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"373 | Colin Camerer on the Neuroscience of Economic Thinking mentalizing cognitive hierarchy model / level-k framing effect burstiness (Poisson non-homogeneity) Neural Autopilot model neural gaslighting\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-mindscape-科学家让大鼠的大脑-骗-自己盐水很好喝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>科學家讓大鼠的大腦「騙」自己鹽水很好喝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者用光遺傳學上調大鼠腦內編碼獎勵信號的神經元，讓它喝到討厭的鹽水時，大腦仍判定「這次很好」——感官與獎勵信號可以被直接割裂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">神經經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $300 Billion Structured Notes Market Is Booming Vega Gamma Auto-callable Worst-of Knock-in / Knock-out Uridashi\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-oddlots-3000亿美元结构票据市场-正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>3000億美元結構票據市場，正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">標普、納指、羅素掛鉤的「表現最差者」自動贖回票據一旦不再按時敲出，交易商被迫同時拋售更多波動率敞口，而願意接盤的做市商卻在收縮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">結構票據</span><span class=\"tag\">衍生品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Airbnb CEO Brian Chesky: “I Was a Great Founder and a Terrible CEO” founder mode skip level\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-howibuilt-airbnb能活下来-是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c49ad29f2140d349-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>Airbnb能活下來，是因為商業模式好到掩蓋了管理混亂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說Airbnb商業模式好到能掩蓋管理混亂，直到疫情把公司逼到生死關頭，他才被迫從放權轉向事必躬親的創始人模式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">領導力</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: Who Wins the Inference Market | Has Open-Source LLM Inference Peaked? | What Happens to the Cost of Compute | The Real Limits of Post-Training and RL with Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO NeoCloud PLG (Product-Led Growth) sandbox\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-twentyvc-ai推理不再有90-毛利-每多一层供应商就分走利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/039f47c822a2df13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>AI推理不再有90%毛利，每多一層供應商就分走利潤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一美元從客戶流到英偉達手裡，要經過應用、模型、基礎設施、雲等好幾層，每層都切走20%到30%的毛利，這就是AI基礎設施公司回不到軟件黃金時代毛利率的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Peter The Great Streltsi Grand Embassy knout fiscal-military state\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-historyhit-彼得大帝西游归来-只搬技术-绝口不提议会与自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e331afa96f76fb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>彼得大帝西遊歸來：只搬技術，絕口不提議會與自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他訪問了光榮革命後的英國和共和制的荷蘭，帶回的只有造船術、刮鬍刀新規和炮臺圖紙，議會與政治自由被原樣留在了西歐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄國歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">彼得大帝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 13: What Is Neuroaffirming ADHD Support? A Counselor Explains neuroaffirming interest-based nervous system MCAS Ehlers-Danlos syndrome executive function\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-parentmojo-adhd不是自控力缺陷-而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD不是自控力缺陷，而是神經系統處理世界的方式不同</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主流框架把ADHD當作執行功能缺陷、靠自控力糾正；這位心理諮詢師認為根源是注意力調節和感官系統天生不同，這套神經系統曾是人類賴以生存的優勢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">神經多樣性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"719. Revolution in the Soviet Empire: The Hungarian Uprising (Part 1) Salami tactics AVH Secret Speech Petofi Circle 16 Points\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-restishistory-点燃匈牙利1956年革命的-是一群诗人作家办的辩论俱乐部/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7094b2e761027f4c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>點燃匈牙利1956年革命的，是一群詩人作家辦的辯論俱樂部</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十一年高壓統治後，真正點燃起義的不是地下黨或工人領袖，而是一群詩人作家辦的公開辯論會，這說明拉科西政權早已只剩暴力，沒有任何人心可守。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰史</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇聯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"409. JFK: The Cuban Missile Crisis (Part 3) ExComm / XCOM Trollope ploy Operation Mongoose Black Saturday soft power\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-empirehist-古巴导弹危机差点开打核战-全靠一名苏联军官投了反对票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>古巴導彈危機差點開打核戰，全靠一名蘇聯軍官投了反對票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇聯核潛艇B-59上，三名軍官裡兩人同意發射核魚雷，唯獨阿爾希波夫一人反對——這一票按蘇聯規定具有否決權，擋住了核戰的引爆點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span><span class=\"tag\">古巴導彈危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Nathanael Greene 2: Logistics of War | | U.S. Revolutionary War History Quartermaster General Fighting Quaker\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-extracredits-独立战争最惨的两年-靠一位不想干后勤的人撑住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">E</div><span class=\"dur\">16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>獨立戰爭最慘的兩年，靠一位不想幹後勤的人撐住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格林打贏過特倫頓和普林斯頓，也在布蘭迪萬和日耳曼敦吃了敗仗，但真正讓大陸軍撐過去的，是他硬著頭皮接下的後勤總管職位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國獨立戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">後勤管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of GLM and China’s Zhipu AI GLM (General Language Model) MoE (Mixture-of-Experts) Model-as-a-Service KEG (Knowledge Engineering Group) P2P (Paper to Product)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-01-asianometry-智谱研发支出是营收两倍-靠免费开源模型换增长能撑多久/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/701791e3cef20e9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">22:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>智譜研發支出是營收兩倍，靠免費開源模型換增長能撐多久</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智譜把最新模型全部開源免費發布，但研發支出已是營收的兩倍——這樁靠燒錢換聲量的生意能撐多久，是全篇最後拋出的真問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智譜AI</span><span class=\"tag\">開源大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"183期重發 | 投資的週期思維、共識遊戲與虧錢教訓 Bullwhip Effect Crossing the Chasm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-01-touzishizhan-全球只有2-4-的公司能让你长期赚钱-其余都该阶段性持有/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>全球只有2.4%的公司能讓你長期賺錢，其餘都該階段性持有</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">統計顯示2.4%之外的公司大多讓收益原地打轉甚至歸零，這期給出了判斷一家公司是否屬於那2.4%的具體方法：預期回報公式、估值錨點和企業生命週期買點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span><span class=\"tag\">資本週期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a 19-year-old intern built the growth engine behind this $2B AI company | Hector Serrano UGC CPM GMV ICP smart retainer ad fatigue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-01-lennys-创作者靠广告分成赚钱-而非播放量-撑起20亿美元ai公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c676784fa788b53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>創作者靠廣告分成賺錢，而非播放量，撐起20億美元AI公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創作者按廣告花費抽成、不設上限，靠「smart retainer」兜底，這套付費UGC體系撐起了Whisperflow過去一年30倍的營收增長。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">付費UGC</span><span class=\"tag\">創作者經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Bending Spoons Built a $20 Billion Compounder | Luca Ferrari SaaSpocalypse\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-01-a16z-ai把代码成本打到近零-但多数软件护城河并未坍塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>AI把代碼成本打到近零，但多數軟件護城河並未坍塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多數規模化軟件產品的複製成本在AI出現前就已經很低，它們真正的護城河是習慣、網絡效應和專有數據，而非代碼本身的稀缺性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">護城河</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1371: How to Bat Away Marburg Virus clade / genotype TMRCA reassortment α-2,6 sialic acid receptor interferon epsilon\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-01-twiv-水貂感染h5n1-传播路径空白三个月-美国农业部选择不查/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>水貂感染H5N1,傳播路徑空白三個月，美國農業部選擇不查</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">得州奶牛場與猶他水貂場的H5N1已經對上信號，但中間三個月的傳播鏈沒人查——美國農業部沒要求撲殺，也不監測工人和周邊農場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">H5N1禽流感</span><span class=\"tag\">水貂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Mycenaeans: Was Agamemnon Real? Linear B Wanax Tholos tomb Cyclopean walls Corbelling Sea Peoples\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-01-ancients-荷马史诗英雄的名字-其实是迈锡尼泥板上的普通人名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f59ba28fc2607a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>荷馬史詩英雄的名字，其實是邁錫尼泥板上的普通人名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">邁錫尼王宮的記賬泥板上，埃特奧克勒斯、阿喀琉斯只是欠王宮東西的普通百姓名字——荷馬史詩裡的英雄名，原來是當時隨處可見的稱呼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">邁錫尼</span><span class=\"tag\">青銅時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Carbon in the Arena, Mistral&#x27;s Le Chonk, the Agent-Run Economy, Ferroelectric RAM + New Hacks EUV Mixture of Experts (MoE) ferroelectric memory APT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-cogrev-生产数据显示openai比anthropic更少撒谎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bce300797e23ca51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>生產數據顯示OpenAI比Anthropic更少撒謊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Arena用真實生產對話打分：OpenAI在未授權操作、虛假歸因、欺騙性完成三項信號上全面反超Anthropic，個位數誤導率換算到真實用量已經相當可觀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Using Agents for Long-Horizon Financial Work — Aman Singh, Arca harness managed agents fiduciary RMD prompt injection\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-ai原生财富管理公司-不是人在催ai-是ai在催人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f748ae3e2793f6d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>AI原生財富管理公司：不是人在催AI，是AI在催人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這家財富管理公司不是套了AI工具的服務商，而是AI原生的公司本身：智能體主動聯繫顧問與客戶、持續追蹤他們的稅務和退休計劃，人類只負責審批和執行交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1112 - Oct 31 2026 Scopus regression discontinuity design Penning trap CPT symmetry APOE4\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-skeptics-超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊-照样被主流数据库收录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>超3500家亮紅燈的問題期刊，照樣被主流數據庫收錄</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究發現3753家期刊出現造假預警信號，其中3557家仍被Scopus正常收錄，說明「發表論文」本身已不再等於可信。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科研誠信</span><span class=\"tag\">期刊造假</span>\n</div></div></a>"]